Hi Pat,

Many thanks for your answer.
Maybe my problem is:

The lavaan input can be:
1. oblique factorscores of unity length
2. oblique factorscores with standarddeviation of one
3. orthogonal factorscores of unity length
4. orthogonal  factorscores with standardeviation of one

The inner product of 1. is a correlationmatrix
The inner product of 2. is the same correlationmatrix
The inner products of 3. en 4. are identity matrices

What to use as input -variables in lavaan?

regards,

Luc

